      "description": "The canonical US technology cost stack: capital cost, fixed and variable O&M, capacity factor and financing assumptions by technology and year, under conservative, moderate and advanced trajectories. Cataloged as one dataset with two domain facets rather than as two records — the storage tables and the generation tables are the same publication and splitting them would double every future update.",
